  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9807045v1</id>
    <title>Exact vortex solutions of the complex sine-Gordon theory on the plane</title>
    <updated>1998-07-07T01:55:06Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9807045v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-th/9807045v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  We construct explicit multivortex solutions for the first and second complex sine-Gordon equations. The constructed solutions are expressible in terms of the modified Bessel and rational functions, respectively. The vorticity-raising and lowering Backlund transformations are interpreted as the Schlesinger transformations of the fifth Painleve equation.</summary>
